{"id":"58c65ff26967e699","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-type-functor.md","title":"类型的判断相等类预层","display":"df-type-functor — 类型的判断相等类预层","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-type-functor","aliases":["16-df-type-functor","Type presheaf"],"display":"df-type-functor — 类型的判断相等类预层","depends_on":["[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-context-category]]","[[16-df-syntactic-substitution]]","[[16-df-set]]"],"source":"§10.3–§10.4, especially p. 612 (PDF 632); quotient object-presheaf presentation","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-type-functor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-type-functor</span><span>Type presheaf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-type-functor — 类型的判断相等类预层"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"42b5ac7685998854\" href=\"?note=42b5ac7685998854\" title=\"16-df-context-category\">16-df-context-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b40125e21710f48\" href=\"?note=3b40125e21710f48\" title=\"16-df-syntactic-substitution\">16-df-syntactic-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§10.3–§10.4, especially p. 612 (PDF 632); quotient object-presheaf presentation"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a> 的 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>，包含有限签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 的全部符号、有限语法树及其商集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"42b5ac7685998854\" href=\"?note=42b5ac7685998854\" title=\"16-df-context-category\">16-df-context-category</a>，其对象是良构原始语境；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Theta\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Theta\\)</span> 为这些对象。</li>\n<li>原始类型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RawTy}\">\\(\\mathsf{RawTy}\\)</span>、判断相等及同时替换采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3b40125e21710f48\" href=\"?note=3b40125e21710f48\" title=\"16-df-syntactic-substitution\">16-df-syntactic-substitution</a> 及其声明的 DTT 演算。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma=\\langle\\Delta,\\Gamma,[\\vec a]\\rangle\">\\(\\sigma=\\langle\\Delta,\\Gamma,[\\vec a]\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle\\Theta,\\Delta,[\\vec b]\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle\\Theta,\\Delta,[\\vec b]\\rangle\\)</span> 为其带源靶标签的箭头。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 的箭头为源、靶、函数图的三元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span> 与反范畴采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 简写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma)_0(\\Gamma)\">\\((\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma)_0(\\Gamma)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\Gamma_T\">\\([A]^\\Gamma_T\\)</span> 只在下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\Gamma\">\\(T_\\Gamma\\)</span> 中取商。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r^T_\\sigma\">\\(r^T_\\sigma\\)</span> 是下式构造的底层函数，函子箭头另保留源靶标签。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nT_\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathsf{RawTy}\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A:\\mathsf{Ty}\\},\\\\\nA\\sim^\\Gamma_T B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow A,B\\in T_\\Gamma\\land\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A=B:\\mathsf{Ty},\\\\\n(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma)_0(\\Gamma)&amp;\\coloneqq T_\\Gamma/{\\sim^\\Gamma_T},\\\\\nr^T_\\sigma([A]^\\Gamma_T)&amp;\\coloneqq[A[\\vec a]]^\\Delta_T\n\\quad\\bigl(\\sigma=\\langle\\Delta,\\Gamma,[\\vec a]\\rangle\\bigr),\\\\\n(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma)_1(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma)_0(\\Gamma),(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma)_0(\\Delta),r^T_\\sigma\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma)_0,(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma)_1\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nT_\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathsf{RawTy}\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A:\\mathsf{Ty}\\},\\\\\nA\\sim^\\Gamma_T B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow A,B\\in T_\\Gamma\\land\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A=B:\\mathsf{Ty},\\\\\n(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma)_0(\\Gamma)&amp;\\coloneqq T_\\Gamma/{\\sim^\\Gamma_T},\\\\\nr^T_\\sigma([A]^\\Gamma_T)&amp;\\coloneqq[A[\\vec a]]^\\Delta_T\n\\quad\\bigl(\\sigma=\\langle\\Delta,\\Gamma,[\\vec a]\\rangle\\bigr),\\\\\n(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma)_1(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma)_0(\\Gamma),(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma)_0(\\Delta),r^T_\\sigma\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma)_0,(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma)_1\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nr^T_\\sigma&amp;:\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\to\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Delta),\\\\\nr^T_{\\operatorname{id}_\\Gamma}&amp;=\\operatorname{id}_{\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)},\\\\\nr^T_{\\sigma\\circ\\tau}&amp;=r^T_\\tau\\circ r^T_\\sigma,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma,\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nr^T_\\sigma&amp;:\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\to\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Delta),\\\\\nr^T_{\\operatorname{id}_\\Gamma}&amp;=\\operatorname{id}_{\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)},\\\\\nr^T_{\\sigma\\circ\\tau}&amp;=r^T_\\tau\\circ r^T_\\sigma,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma,\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>对替换代表、类型代表的独立性由判断相等的替换规则得到。原文件若使用未取商的原始类型，就不能让它沿已取商的语境态射成为严格函子。</li>\n<li>这是类型对象的集合预层；本书 §10.4 的类型纤维范畴还含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash t:B\">\\(\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash t:B\\)</span> 这样的函数项箭头，不是此预层的离散元素范畴。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，§10.3–§10.4, especially p. 612 (PDF 632); quotient object-presheaf presentation。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-context-category","status":"resolved","id":"42b5ac7685998854","ancho