a_T$ 只在下式的 $T_\\Gamma$ 中取商。$r^T_\\sigma$ 是下式构造的底层函数，函子箭头另保留源靶标签。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RawTy}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma=\\langle\\Delta,\\Gamma,[\\vec a]\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle\\Theta,\\Delta,[\\vec b]\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma)_0(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^\\Gamma_T","display":false},{"tex":"T_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"r^T_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nT_\\Gamma&\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathsf{RawTy}\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A:\\mathsf{Ty}\\},\\\\\nA\\sim^\\Gamma_T B&\\Longleftrightarrow A,B\\in T_\\Gamma\\land\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A=B:\\mathsf{Ty},\\\\\n(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma)_0(\\Gamma)&\\coloneqq T_\\Gamma/{\\sim^\\Gamma_T},\\\\\nr^T_\\sigma([A]^\\Gamma_T)&\\coloneqq[A[\\vec a]]^\\Delta_T\n\\quad\\bigl(\\sigma=\\langle\\Delta,\\Gamma,[\\vec a]\\rangle\\bigr),\\\\\n(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma)_1(\\sigma)&\\coloneqq\n\\langle(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma)_0(\\Gamma),(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma)_0(\\Delta),r^T_\\sigma\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma&\\coloneqq\n\\langle(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma)_0,(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma)_1\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nr^T_\\sigma&:\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\to\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Delta),\\\\\nr^T_{\\operatorname{id}_\\Gamma}&=\\operatorname{id}_{\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)},\\\\\nr^T_{\\sigma\\circ\\tau}&=r^T_\\tau\\circ r^T_\\sigma,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma,\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})&.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash t:B","display":false}],"bytes":3007,"backlinks":[{"id":"2cbe3d8d855b52d0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma:\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 采用 [[16-df-type-functor]]；$\\Sigma$ 是该页使用的有限强 DTT 展示，所有语法树与商集在同一足够大的 $\\mathcal U$ 中。语法判断与同时替换采用 [[16-df-syntactic-substitution]]。"},{"id":"5b648e8767bd12be","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ 采用 [[16-df-type-functor]] 所引用的有限强一阶依赖展示。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-pca]]、[[16-df-kleene-numbering]]、[[16-df-realizability-fibration]]、[[16-df-set-of-fibration]]、[[16-df-eff-topos]]、[[16-df-effective-global-sections]]、[[16-df-assembly]]、[[16-df-per-category]]、[[16-df-ufam-per]]、[[16-df-context-category]]、[[16-df-syntactic-substitution]]、[[16-df-type-functor]]、[[16-df-term-functor]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]、[[16-thm-reynolds]]。"}],"outgoing":["fc49efccd7348d66","42b5ac7685998854","3b40125e21710f48","09b2ae01fb2d54e3"]}